              <math id="algorithm1.m17" class="ltx_Math" alttext="T_{\text{cand}}\leftarrow\min_{s}\{\cdots\}+(B-1)\,t_{\max}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>𝑻</mi><mtext>cand</mtext></msub><mo class="ltx_mathvariant_bold" mathvariant="bold" stretchy="false">←</mo><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>𝐦𝐢𝐧</mi><mi>𝒔</mi></msub><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><mo class="ltx_mathvariant_bold" lspace="0em" mathvariant="bold" rspace="0em">⋯</mo><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow></mrow><mo class="ltx_mathvariant_bold" mathvariant="bold">+</mo><mrow><mrow><mo class="ltx_mathvariant_bold" mathvariant="bold" stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>𝑩</mi><mo class="ltx_mathvariant_bold" mathvariant="bold">−</mo><mn>𝟏</mn></mrow><mo class="ltx_mathvariant_bold" mathvariant="bold" stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0.170em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>𝒕</mi><mi>𝐦𝐚𝐱</mi></msub></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">T_{\text{cand}}\leftarrow\min_{s}\{\cdots\}+(B-1)\,t_{\max}</annotation></semantics></math>  (Eq. (<a href="#S5.E13" title="In 5.2.1. Cost Model and DP Formulation ‣ 5.2. Heterogeneous Inter-op Parallel Strategy Searching Algorithm ‣ 5. Fine-grained Heterogeneous Inter-op Parallel Strategy Planner ‣ HAPT: Heterogeneity-Aware Automated Parallel Training on Heterogeneous Clusters" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">13</span></a>))
</div>
